stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Parent and transport hold the lock
  s1: Parent holds the lock
  s2: Parent stopped, no descriptor remains
  s3: Parent stopped, transport holds the lock
  s4: Parent waits for the lock
  s5: Transport stopped, parent holds the lock
  [*] --> s4
  s0 --> s3: Parent exits
  s0 --> s5: Transport closes its descriptor
  s1 --> s0: Transport inherits the descriptor
  s1 --> s2: Parent closes its descriptor
  s1 --> s2: Parent exits
  s3 --> s2: Transport closes its descriptor
  s4 --> s1: Parent acquires the lock
  s4 --> s2: Parent exits
  s5 --> s2: Parent closes its descriptor
  s5 --> s2: Parent exits
